## Limitations And Next Evidence

- Baseline Jira filter is not proof of complete Rehor history.
- Memory-server tasks, dashboard cost cycles, and cycle-run transcripts are separate populations.
- Local pre-deployment work is not represented and cannot be reliably reconstructed. Its relative share should decline over time as new persisted work accumulates.
- App-interface exposes deployment/configuration references, not Vault secret values.
- Current report should be extended with exported developer-machine logs and historical personal-account PR/MR searches.
